Testing _mulle_vm_page_insert_bytes function
============================================

=== Test: Clean Append ===
Initial: used={5,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "DEF" range: location={13, 3}
Result: 0
After append: used={5,6}, size=64
  Content: "ABCDEF"

=== Test: Clean Prepend ===
Initial: used={20,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "XYZ" range: location={7, 3}
Result: 0
After prepend: used={17,6}, size=64
  Content: "XYZABC"

=== Test: Intersection Insert ===
Initial: used={10,4}, size=64
  Content: "ABCD"
Insert data: "XY" range: location={12, 2}
Result: 0
After intersection: used={8,6}, size=64
  Content: "ABXYCD"

=== Test: Non-Adjacent (Invalid) ===
Initial: used={5,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "XYZ" range: location={20, 3}
Result: 22 (EINVAL=22)
After failed insert: used={5,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"

=== Test: Insufficient Space ===
Initial: used={2,3}, size=16
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "TOO_LONG_TO_FIT" range: location={13, 15}
Result: 28 (ENOSPC=28)
After failed insert: used={2,3}, size=16
  Content: "ABC"

=== Test: Append with Compaction ===
Initial: used={25,3}, size=32
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "DEF" range: location={13, 3}
Result: 0
After append with compaction: used={25,6}, size=32
  Content: "ABCDEF"

=== Test: Prepend with Compaction ===
Initial: used={0,3}, size=32
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "XYZ" range: location={7, 3}
Result: 0
After prepend with compaction: used={26,6}, size=32
  Content: "XYZABC"

=== Test: Edge Cases ===
Initial (zero-length test): used={10,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "" range: location={13, 0}
Zero-length insert result: 0
After zero-length insert: used={10,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"

--- Insert at exact start ---
Initial (start test): used={10,3}, size=64
  Content: "ABC"
Insert data: "XY" range: location={10, 2}
Insert at start result: 0
After start insert: used={8,5}, size=64
  Content: "XYABC"

=== Test: Empty Page Operations ===
Initial empty page: used={0,0}, size=64
Insert data: "FIRST" range: location={100, 5}
Result: 0
After insert to empty page: used={0,5}, size=64
  Content: "FIRST"

All tests completed.
